// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x001E30F5 size=41 name=?rva001E30F5@Rva001E30F5@@QAEXHH@Z evidence=?:placeholder tier=B hypothesis:K
// A simple buff names one thing template; it brings that template's assets.
void BuffNuggetFXNugget::GetAssetList(AssetList &assets, Int context) const
{
	if (!m_isComplexBuff)
	{
		const ThingTemplate *tmpl = TheThingFactory->findTemplate(m_buffThingTemplate);
		if (tmpl != NULL)
			const_cast<ThingTemplate *>(tmpl)->GetAssetList((Int)&assets, context);
	}
}

// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x001E311E size=285 name=?doFXObj@BuffNuggetFXNugget@@UBEXPBVObject@@0@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=B hypothesis:K
void BuffNuggetFXNugget::doFXObj(const Object *primary, const Object *secondary) const
{
	if (primary == NULL)
		return;
	Drawable *draw = primary->getDrawable();
	if (draw == NULL)
		return;

	if ((Int)m_buffLifeTime <= 0)
	{
		draw->rva00271BCC(m_buffType, 0);
		return;
	}

	if (m_isComplexBuff)
	{
		draw->rva00271B5C(m_buffType, NULL, m_buffLifeTime, &m_color, m_extrusion);
		return;
	}

	// hordes take no buff object; otherwise pick the template by the kind of unit
	const ThingTemplate *tmpl = primary->m_template;
	if (tmpl->isKindOf(KINDOF_HORDE))
		return;
	const AsciiString *name;
	if (tmpl->isKindOf(KINDOF_CAVALRY))
		name = &m_buffCavalryTemplate;
	else if (tmpl->isKindOf(KINDOF_ORC))
		name = &m_buffOrcTemplate;
	else if (tmpl->isKindOf(KINDOF_INFANTRY))
		name = &m_buffInfantryTemplate;
	else if (tmpl->isKindOf(KINDOF_TROLL_BUFF_NUGGET))
		name = &m_buffTrollTemplate;
	else if (tmpl->isKindOf(KINDOF_MUMAKIL_BUFF_NUGGET))
		name = &m_buffMumakilTemplate;
	else if (tmpl->isKindOf(KINDOF_SHIP))
		name = &m_buffShipTemplate;
	else if (tmpl->isKindOf(KINDOF_MONSTER))
		name = &m_buffMonsterTemplate;
	else
		name = &m_buffThingTemplate;

	const ThingTemplate *buff = TheThingFactory->findTemplate(*name);
	if (buff == NULL)
		return;
	draw->rva00271B5C(m_buffType, buff, m_buffLifeTime, &m_color, m_extrusion);
}

